AB  - In order to completely overhaul logistics operations, this article investigates the revolutionary possibilities of incorporating quantum computing algorithms into blockchain-based supply chain management systems. Route planning and inventory management can be optimised using this novel technique, which combines the security and openness of blockchain technology with the enormous computational capacity of quantum computing. Quantum algorithms can find the best supply chain optimisation solutions by analysing large datasets. This can result in significant cost reductions, increased efficiency, and better resource allocation. The conceptual framework and possible advantages of utilising quantum-driven tactics in blockchain-enabled supply chain management are described in this paper, opening the door to a new era of operational excellence and logistical optimisation. Β© The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd. 2026.
