TI  - A Multifaceted Deepfake Prevention Framework Integrating Blockchain, Post-Quantum Cryptography, Hybrid Watermarking, Human Oversight, and Policy Governance
PY  - 2025
T2  - Computers
VL  - 14
IS  - 11
C7  - 488
DO  - 10.3390/computers14110488
