AB  - To ensure privacy and security in a quantum computing environment, we use the proxy signcryption from NTRU lattice to construct a blockchain-based insurance claim scheme (BCICS). BCICS has low-communication overhead and high-computing efficiency because the NTRU lattice has a short key size and small key storage space. BCICS has the unforgeability and confidentiality of insurance claims under the hardness of small integer solution in the ring (RSIS) and learning with errors in the ring (RLWE) in the NTRU lattice. BCICS can provide a reliable antiquantum solution for the insurance claim industry. Β© 2001-2012 IEEE.
