TI  - Blockchain Security Risk Assessment in Quantum Era, Migration Strategies, and Proactive Defense
PY  - 2026
T2  - IEEE Communications Surveys and Tutorials
VL  - 28
SP  - 2925
EP  - 2964
DO  - 10.1109/COMST.2025.3621113
