TI  - Enhanced Proxy Re-Encryption With Blockchain For Privacy-Preserving IOT Data Exchange
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Conference on Computational Robotics, Testing and Engineering Evaluation, ICCRTEE 2025
DO  - 10.1109/ICCRTEE64519.2025.11053119
