TI  - Jupyter Notebook Attacks Taxonomy: Ransomware, Data Exfiltration, and Security Misconfiguration
PY  - 2024
T2  - Proceedings of SC 2024-W: Workshops of the International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking, Storage and Analysis
SP  - 750
EP  - 754
