AB  - Cloud computing has revolutionized how organizations store, access, and manage data, offering unparalleled flexibility, scalability, and efficiency. As organizations increasingly adopt cloud-based solutions, the importance of implementing robust security frameworks has grown exponentially to address evolving threats. This chapter provides a comprehensive exploration of data security and network security in the context of cloud computing. It covers foundational principles, advanced strategies, and emerging trends to protect sensitive information and maintain operational resilience. It emphasizes protecting data integrity, confidentiality, and availability while addressing strategies to identify, mitigate, and prevent network-based threats. Technological advancements like AI-driven threat detection, blockchain-based data integrity solutions, and quantum-safe encryption are explored for their transformative potential. With the rapid evolution of cyber risks, this chapter highlights proactive measures and best practices for securing sensitive data and critical cloud systems. Β© 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
