AB  - Blockchain is the mechanism that makes security harder or difficult to hack, alter, or scam the system. Blockchain is very familiar because it has a digital transaction ledger distributed across the network. Every block in the chain has many new transactions that are added to the ledger. The ledger is maintained in the decen- tralized database by multiple participants, which is termed as Distributed Ledger Technology (DLT). DLT is secure, distributed, immutable, and time-stamped. Similar to classic databases, blockchain also stores a copy of blocks. The key fea- tures of quantum blockchain are performance and safety. Moreover, quantum blockchain has faster processing speed and safer transactions based on quantum mechanics. To corrupt a system, every block in a chain has to be changed. Hence, the system is highly secured. Β© 2022 Scrivener Publishing LLC.
