TI  - Improving Bitcoin's Post-Quantum Transaction Efficiency with a Novel Lattice-Based Aggregate Signature Scheme Based on CRYSTALS-Dilithium and a STARK Protocol
PY  - 2022
T2  - IEEE Access
VL  - 10
SP  - 132472
